MID_MV13_09: <SH>
MID_MV13_09_m001: (contemplative exert)
MID_MV13_09_m002: (wary exhale)
MID_MV13_09_m003: Sembra che ciò che cerchiamo\nsi celi dietro questa porta.
MID_MV13_09_m004: (small reaction sound)
MID_MV13_09_m005: (impressed sound)
MID_MV13_09_m006: (impressed sound)
MID_MV13_09_m007: (impressed sound)
MID_MV13_09_m008: (affirming/confirmation sound)
MID_MV13_09_m009: (affirming/confirmation sound)
MID_MV13_09_m010: (affirming/confirmation sound)
MID_MV13_09_m011: (affirming/confirmation sound)
MID_MV13_09_m012: Qualcosa non quadra, qui.
MID_MV13_09_m013: Questo posto è vuoto!
MID_MV13_09_m014: Deve trattarsi di un errore.
MID_MV13_09_m015: (breath sound)
MID_MV13_09_m016: Un momento. Ha cambiato posizione!
MID_MV13_09_m017: Come è possibile?
MID_MV13_09_m018: Ehi...
MID_MV13_09_m019: Verso che direzione sta indicando quell'aggeggio?
MID_MV13_09_m020: Indica che siamo giunti a destinazione.
MID_MV13_09_m021: Quindi... dovrebbe essere\na portata di mano.
MID_MV13_09_m022: Non so te, ma io non vedo nulla.
MID_MV13_09_m023: E se si trovasse... sotto di noi?
MID_MV13_09_m024: (sound of surprise)
MID_MV13_09_m025: (sound of surprise)
MID_MV13_09_m026: (sound of surprise)
MID_MV13_09_m027: (sound of surprise)
MID_MV13_09_m028: (shout exert)
MID_MV13_09_m029: (shout exert)
MID_MV13_09_m030: (shout exert)
MID_MV13_09_m031: (shout exert)
MID_MV13_09_m032: (shout exert)
MID_MV13_09_m033: (breathy concerned exert)
MID_MV13_09_m034: (exert as she lands)
MID_MV13_09_m035: (shout as she leaps) ... (attack exert)
MID_MV13_09_m036: (exert as she lands)
MID_MV13_09_m037: (shout exert)
MID_MV13_09_m038: (pained exert)
MID_MV13_09_m039: (pained exert)
MID_MV13_09_m040: (sigh of relief)
MID_MV13_09_m041: (exert of readiness)
MID_MV13_09_m042: Non ho mai visto un verme delle sabbie così.\nStiamo per affrontare un essere ignoto.
MID_MV13_09_m043: (surprised exert)
MID_MV13_09_m044: (surprised exert)
MID_MV13_09_m045: (surprised exert)
MID_MV13_09_m046: (surprised exert)
MID_MV13_09_m047: (alert breath exert)
MID_MV13_09_m048: (alert breath exert)
MID_MV13_09_m049: (alert breath exert)
MID_MV13_09_m050: (alert breath exert)
MID_MV13_09_m051: Il segnale sembra provenire da loro.
MID_MV13_09_m052: Ottimo, questo ci semplifica le cose.
MID_MV13_09_m053: Ognuno di essi morirà. Dopodiché,\nscaveremo tra le loro carcasse!